	(text "Power and IO. 9 V centre-negative on J401, a PJ-063AH PCB-mounted at the top wall (as The Alchemist). SS34 series protection, 47R/47u, V_Bias divider (buffered on the Mix sheet as U301B), 5 V for the PT2399, 3.3 V for the MCU. IN (J402, right wall) and OUT (J403, left wall) are Neutrik NRJ6HM-1 jacks PCB-mounted on the underside. Relay bypass K401 with a momentary footswitch on J405, LED D401L driven by Q402 (see below)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 30 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2a21e8ea-f3cf-4d3f-9427-f05c8720ad5b")
	)
