	(text "Relay bypass (2026-10-04), replaces the 3PDT tile and J404. K401 rest position is true bypass: IN to OUT, effect input grounded; it also passes the signal unpowered. The MCU reads the momentary footswitch on J405 (PA7, internal pull-up), drives K401 through Q401 (PB0) and the effect LED through Q402 (PB1), and mutes the wet path with the dropout shunt Q302 for a few ms around each change. R407 and R409 hold both off while the MCU resets."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 125 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c562c7dd-14e4-414a-873e-8927b1e4cf39")
	)
)
